---

This engine reimplements behaviour published by the OpenROAD project's global router
(https://github.com/The-OpenROAD-Project/OpenROAD, BSD-3-Clause). It is a reimplementation from
published behaviour, not a transliteration, and carries no OpenROAD source.

The CUGR router (`src/cugr/`, `global_route -use_cugr`) reimplements the behaviour of CUGR 2.0,
the global router of the EDGE paper by researchers at The Chinese University of Hong Kong, as the
OpenROAD project embeds it. The algorithm is theirs; this crate carries none of its source. The
credit is attribution only and implies no endorsement by the authors or their university.

The library in this crate is self-contained: it computes guide geometry from route segments and
carries no runtime data files.
